&lt;p data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;152&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;150&quot;&gt;About Clutch&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;154&quot; data-end=&quot;240&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to reinvent the way people buy, sell, and own cars. Are you game?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;242&quot; data-end=&quot;582&quot;&gt;Clutch is Canada’s largest online used car retailer, delivering a seamless, hassle-free car-buying experience to drivers everywhere. Customers can browse hundreds of cars from the comfort of their home, get the right one delivered to their door, and enjoy peace of mind with our 10-Day Money-Back Guarantee… and that’s just the beginning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;584&quot; data-end=&quot;843&quot;&gt;Named five years in a row to the Globe &amp;amp; Mail’s list of the Top Growing Companies in Canada and also awarded spots on Deloitte’s Technology Fast 50™ and Fast 500™ lists, we’re looking to add curious, hard-working, and driven individuals to our growing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;845&quot; data-end=&quot;1165&quot;&gt;Headquartered in Toronto, Clutch was founded in 2017 and currently services Ontario, New Brunswick, Nova Scotia, British Columbia, and Prince Edward Island. Clutch is backed by a number of world-class investors, including D1 Capital, Canaan, Real Ventures, BrandProject, and Upper90. To learn more, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1150&quot; data-end=&quot;1163&quot;&gt;clutch.ca&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1167&quot; data-end=&quot;1187&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1167&quot; data-end=&quot;1185&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1189&quot; data-end=&quot;1536&quot;&gt;We are on a mission to build a world-class team that drives innovation, growth, and excellence. As we scale rapidly, we are looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1327&quot; data-end=&quot;1358&quot;&gt;Vehicle Inventory Associate&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our Production team. This role ensures accurate and detailed vehicle data is entered into our inventory system so every car meets Clutch’s quality and sales standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1538&quot; data-end=&quot;1558&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1538&quot; data-end=&quot;1556&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1560&quot; data-end=&quot;2039&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1560&quot; data-end=&quot;1618&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1562&quot; data-end=&quot;1618&quot;&gt;Manually identify and capture features within vehicles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1619&quot; data-end=&quot;1677&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1621&quot; data-end=&quot;1677&quot;&gt;Use captured features to determine vehicle trim levels&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1678&quot; data-end=&quot;1805&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1680&quot; data-end=&quot;1805&quot;&gt;Copy data from documents into our vehicle inventory system (CarFax information, vehicle specifications, recall information)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1806&quot; data-end=&quot;1883&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1808&quot; data-end=&quot;1883&quot;&gt;Complete uploads for each vehicle in a fast-paced, repetitive environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1884&quot; data-end=&quot;1967&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1886&quot; data-end=&quot;1967&quot;&gt;Collaborate with production teams as needed (detailing, shuttling, inspections)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1968&quot; data-end=&quot;2039&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1970&quot; data-end=&quot;2039&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate and organized records for inventory and reporting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2041&quot; data-end=&quot;2069&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2041&quot; data-end=&quot;2067&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2071&quot; data-end=&quot;2475&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2071&quot; data-end=&quot;2119&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2073&quot; data-end=&quot;2119&quot;&gt;Education: High school diploma or equivalent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2120&quot; data-end=&quot;2168&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2122&quot; data-end=&quot;2168&quot;&gt;License: Valid G2 driver’s license (Ontario)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2169&quot; data-end=&quot;2238&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2171&quot; data-end=&quot;2238&quot;&gt;Driving Record: Clean driver’s abstract with no major infractions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2239&quot; data-end=&quot;2292&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2241&quot; data-end=&quot;2292&quot;&gt;Background Check: Clean criminal background check&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2293&quot; data-end=&quot;2353&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2295&quot; data-end=&quot;2353&quot;&gt;Work Authorization: Legally authorized to work in Canada&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2354&quot; data-end=&quot;2475&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2356&quot; data-end=&quot;2475&quot;&gt;Availability: Able to commit to a full-time schedule of 40 hours per week, including overtime based on business needs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2477&quot; data-end=&quot;2502&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2477&quot; data-end=&quot;2500&quot;&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2504&quot; data-end=&quot;2981&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2504&quot; data-end=&quot;2556&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2506&quot; data-end=&quot;2556&quot;&gt;High proficiency in English (written and verbal)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2557&quot; data-end=&quot;2618&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2559&quot; data-end=&quot;2618&quot;&gt;Familiarity with vehicle features commonly sold in Canada&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2619&quot; data-end=&quot;2694&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2621&quot; data-end=&quot;2694&quot;&gt;Previous data entry experience with high accuracy (Google Docs, Sheets)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2695&quot; data-end=&quot;2758&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2697&quot; data-end=&quot;2758&quot;&gt;Ability to multitask in a fast-paced production environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2759&quot; data-end=&quot;2816&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2761&quot; data-end=&quot;2816&quot;&gt;Knowledge of common car brands in the Canadian market&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2817&quot; data-end=&quot;2889&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2819&quot; data-end=&quot;2889&quot;&gt;Ability to operate various vehicles (manual and automatic is a plus)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2890&quot; data-end=&quot;2932&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2892&quot; data-end=&quot;2932&quot;&gt;Professional appearance and work ethic&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2933&quot; data-end=&quot;2981&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2935&quot; data-end=&quot;2981&quot;&gt;Effective interpersonal communication skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2983&quot; data-end=&quot;3017&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2983&quot; data-end=&quot;3015&quot;&gt;Why you’ll love it at Clutch&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3019&quot; data-end=&quot;3249&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3019&quot; data-end=&quot;3090&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3021&quot; data-end=&quot;3090&quot;&gt;Autonomy &amp;amp; ownership – opportunity to influence production workflow&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3091&quot; data-end=&quot;3118&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3093&quot; data-end=&quot;3118&quot;&gt;Competitive hourly wage&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3119&quot; data-end=&quot;3153&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3121&quot; data-end=&quot;3153&quot;&gt;Opportunities for overtime pay&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3154&quot; data-end=&quot;3182&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3156&quot; data-end=&quot;3182&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; dental benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3183&quot; data-end=&quot;3249&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3185&quot; data-end=&quot;3249&quot;&gt;Growth potential and training within the Production department&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3251&quot; data-end=&quot;3304&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3251&quot; data-end=&quot;3270&quot;&gt;Employment Type&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;3270&quot; data-end=&quot;3273&quot;&gt;Existing, Permanent Full-Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3306&quot; data-end=&quot;3335&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3306&quot; data-end=&quot;3333&quot;&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3337&quot; data-end=&quot;3530&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3337&quot; data-end=&quot;3362&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3339&quot; data-end=&quot;3362&quot;&gt;Wage: $20.00 per hour&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3363&quot; data-end=&quot;3401&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3365&quot; data-end=&quot;3401&quot;&gt;Benefits: Health &amp;amp; dental coverage&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3402&quot; data-end=&quot;3530&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3404&quot; data-end=&quot;3530&quot;&gt;Pay decisions reflect objective criteria: skills, performance, market benchmarking, responsibilities, and working conditions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3532&quot; data-end=&quot;3745&quot;&gt;Clutch is committed to fostering an inclusive workplace where all individuals have an opportunity to succeed. If you require accommodation at any stage of the interview process, please email&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3723&quot; data-end=&quot;3743&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;decorated-link cursor-pointer&quot; data-start=&quot;3725&quot; data-end=&quot;3741&quot;&gt;talent@clutch.ca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
